OL,3,GNEWSACourt date for two men charged
OL,4,Awith murder of cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men charged with murder after the
OL,7,Fdeath of a 27-year-old cyclist in
OL,8,FLeicester will appear at crown court.
OL,10,FGeorge Glover was punched as he rode
OL,11,Falong Narborough Road, close to the
OL,12,Fjunction with Noel Street, at about
OL,13,F06:30 BST on Monday, and died in
OL,14,Fhospital on Thursday, Leicestershire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FChae Smith, 31, and 24-year-old Joshua
OL,18,FCook, both of no fixed address, have
OL,19,Fbeen charged with murder and one count
OL,20,Fof robbery, said the force.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
