OL,3,GNEWSACourt date for two men charged
OL,4,Awith murder of cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter appearing at Leicester
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on Monday, they were
OL,8,Ffurther remanded in custody and will
OL,9,Fappear at Leicester Crown Court on 12
OL,10,FOctober.
